The binary uses exactly 8/3 and 4/3 as single-precision floats. My `2.666667f` literal compiles to a different value! The literal `2.666667f` becomes `0x402aaab0` while `8.0f/3.0f` becomes `0x402aaaab`. Let me fix this:

